{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an open world, Role Playing game, placed in an ancient, fantasy world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with mythological Dragons, Demons and Awesome Adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as one of the Four Classes; Fighter, Ranger, Rogue or Wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then you creating your own Unique Path.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/197d61a7815a3c61225febbd28a7be7c.avif?t=1776537952\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have spend a lot of time to reduce\u00a0choice paralysis, making it easy to play this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No\u00a0choice overload, and very little Decision Fatigue, by limiting the choice you are forced to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an open world, so you can nearly do what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create A house, or fish in the lakes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go on Quests and fight Dragons or Demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s 'Lord of the Rings' universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8ab1d9b80b192bcbc4c9969296bbe16671b255d2.jpg","localized_name":"Visit WolfShire","name":"Visit WolfShire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8ab1d9b80b192bcbc4c9969296bbe16671b255d2.jpg"},{"icon":"6cbb0ffd749d6aba9584fe6fe0865ca84eaba61d.jpg","localized_name":"Visit MossField","name":"Visit MossField","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/6cbb0ffd749d6aba9584fe6fe0865ca84eaba61d.jpg"},{"icon":"92639f450cb82409d0c5a64cf9b4ae1bf4c0cb9d.jpg","localized_name":"Casual: Row Your Boat","name":"Casual: Row Your Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/92639f450cb82409d0c5a64cf9b4ae1bf4c0cb9d.jpg"},{"icon":"3a7785567e03485d6876e6afaef86ef60900311e.jpg","localized_name":"Casual: Just 5 more Minutes","name":"Casual: Just 5 more Minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/3a7785567e03485d6876e6afaef86ef60900311e.jpg"},{"icon":"8e4d14c74ee149305c88f94d26aed06e87fa780f.jpg","localized_name":"Casual: Sitting Down","name":"Casual: Sitting Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8e4d14c74ee149305c88f94d26aed06e87fa780f.jpg"},{"icon":"ebe620fe91c50b33e755e447bf278e6f18292d23.jpg","localized_name":"Animals: Riding a Mount ","name":"Animals: Riding a Mount ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/ebe620fe91c50b33e755e447bf278e6f18292d23.jpg"},{"icon":"7a5687da4fccbf7e85d8d3f76e063173d512bd94.jpg","localized_name":"Killed a Golden Spider","name":"Killed a Golden Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7a5687da4fccbf7e85d8d3f76e063173d512bd94.jpg"},{"icon":"5ce8ac95a57d96b9c86f823df22598a352477ec2.jpg","localized_name":"Open First Page","name":"Open First Page","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/5ce8ac95a57d96b9c86f823df22598a352477ec2.jpg"},{"icon":"7b867e2a2f71a16b432213fd9ec67697da8e190a.jpg","localized_name":"Start as Human","name":"Start as Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7b867e2a2f71a16b432213fd9ec67697da8e190a.jpg"},{"icon":"9d7f8d101b15ef95000aab798cf78b003c7a8825.jpg","localized_name":"Start as Hafling","name":"Start as Hafling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/9d7f8d101b15ef95000aab798cf78b003c7a8825.jpg"}],"total":75},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1078610?t=1776537952","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/29b5eab218f12a4a8138a59a889b0ed29523d00f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776537952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/32d53fc8eb9ac3183e2f518ae6cee53f12ff21b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776537952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/32d53fc8eb9ac3183e2f518ae6cee53f12ff21b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776537952","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2614440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an open world, Role Playing game, placed in an ancient, fantasy world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with mythological Dragons, Demons and Awesome Adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as one of the Four Classes; Fighter, Ranger, Rogue or Wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then you creating your own Unique Path.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/197d61a7815a3c61225febbd28a7be7c.avif?t=1776537952\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have spend a lot of time to reduce\u00a0choice paralysis, making it easy to play this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No\u00a0choice overload, and very little Decision Fatigue, by limiting the choice you are forced to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an open world, so you can nearly do what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create A house, or fish in the lakes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go on Quests and fight Dragons or Demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s 'Lord of the Rings' universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>","developers":["J. C. SpringBourne"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/3fe9f8bf1ccfd2e620dfe3aa4f7bce8349c0840f/header.jpg?t=1776537952","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr